+## Built State
+- **Mission field on Job (additive):** `mission: str | None = None` on
+  `packages/core/models.py:Job`. Pre-F147 JSON without the field loads
+  unchanged (`mission=None`).
+- **Bare-mission golden path:** `remedy do "<mission>"` detected via
+  two-stage mechanism: injection marker (`args._injected_default` set in
+  `grouped.py` when `_DEFAULT_COMMAND` injects `run`) plus argv-level
+  bareness scan (`args._truly_bare` — no `-`-starting token after mission
+  except `--json`/`--repo`). Creates a planned job with deterministic
+  skeleton tasks and label `plan: deterministic skeleton (LLM Flight Plan
+  lands with F013/F014)` — label asserted in test so F013/F014 must
+  consciously flip it.
+- **Status command:** `apps/cli/commands/status_cmd.py` — 4 sections
+  (jobs, decisions, runtime, stops), `--json` schema with `scope: "all
+  projects"`, per-section `Next:` lines, always exit 0. Runtime uses
+  `load_state_result()` (STATE_ABSENT → stopped, corrupt → unknown +
+  warning). Decisions use `load_run_events()` (not empty list). Stops
+  use `safe_points.stop_requested()` (F011 kill-switch, not blocker
+  stop-reasons).
+- **Help pinning:** GROUPS order in `command_catalog.py` pins
+  do/status/decision first.
+- **Job-stop Core-store fallback:** `job_stop_cmd._load_job` falls back
+  to `storage.load_job` via `_CoreJobAdapter` when pingpong miss, so
+  `remedy job stop` works for golden-path jobs.
+- **Tests:** `tests/cli/test_golden_path.py` — 29 tests across
+  TestDoMission (13), TestStatus (14), TestHelpPinning (1),
+  TestGoldenPathSmoke (1: init → do → status → stop → status).
+
 ## Do not touch
 Planner internals (the Flight Plan replaces them), decision answering,
 runtime serve/stop semantics, the help taxonomy beyond pinning. Suggested
